{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>רשים.</b> רשם, and like it is רשום בכתב." "<b>מנא.</b> Everything that is counted is reckoned. Further: because the word פרסין is two. One פרס — namely the distribution of the breaking of his kingdom and their cutting off. And the second פרס — from the decree of Media and Persia; therefore he said: \"and it was given to Media and Persia.\""], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:03.172688660Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}